UPDATE scholarships SET notes = notes || ' PASS 124 RECHECK 2026-10-28 (no disposition - row deliberately left active at rel 4): the stored official page (international.cvut.cz CTU scholarships) is still unreachable to this project''s fetcher - HTTP 500 on both https and http attempts today, following the 2026-10-26 fetch failure; direct curl is egress-blocked in the sandbox. Web-search indexing of that same official page (indexed 2025-09-19; re-surfaced 2026-10-28) shows it live and carrying "Rules for awarding scholarships to foreign students in doctoral study programmes at CTU" - search-index text mentions coverage of the basic doctoral scholarship and living costs up to CzK 16 000 per month, a 6-12 month award extendable for excellent outcomes, 50/50 rectorate/faculty financing, exclusions (Erasmus/exchange and government-scholarship holders), application via the faculty International Office to the Department of International Relations with vice-rector decision, and a publication-or-grant-application outcome duty. This matches the shape of sibling 875, verified first-hand from the same page on 2026-10-23 for the master''s variant (up to CzK 10 000 per month). The PhD figures above are search-index provenance ONLY - deliberately NOT encoded in any term field (house first-hand rule; cf. 477/IITD). The award is treated as real, so retirement would be wrong; the honest placeholder text stands. Next cycle: retry the first-hand fetch (or a cvut.cz mirror of the rules) and rewrite this row; also queue sibling 875 hygiene for a future uplift (amount_usd_value 4300 conversion and stored minima).', last_updated_at = now() WHERE id = 876;

